## Target User Profile

**Primary User:** Sociology researcher conducting qualitative interviews

**Typical Workflow:**
1. Records interview via Zoom with separate audio tracks per speaker
2. Has two audio files: interviewer (MA-*) and participant (P*)
3. Wants accurate, de-identified transcripts for research analysis
4. Needs to review and correct automated transcription errors
5. Must ensure de-identification is complete before sharing/publishing

**Technical Assumptions:**
- Desktop/laptop user (no mobile support required)
- Minimum screen resolution: 1280 × 800
- Modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- May run web interface on laptop while pipeline executes on remote server

