## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Foundation
**Goal:** Basic web server with job submission and monitoring

- [ ] Set up FastAPI backend with project structure
- [ ] Create job submission endpoint (file upload, configuration)
- [ ] Implement job queue with background task processing
- [ ] Add SSE endpoint for job progress updates
- [ ] Create basic React frontend scaffold
- [ ] Build job configuration form
- [ ] Build job monitoring view with progress indicators
- [ ] Connect to existing pipeline via subprocess/import

### Phase 2: Transcript Viewing
**Goal:** View and navigate transcripts with audio sync

- [ ] Design transcript data API (JSON structure)
- [ ] Implement stage-specific transcript endpoints
- [ ] Integrate wavesurfer.js for audio playback
- [ ] Build transcript display component with speaker colors
- [ ] Implement word-level click to seek
- [ ] Implement playback-follows-transcript highlighting
- [ ] Add timestamp display and navigation
- [ ] Build stage selector dropdown
- [ ] Handle dual audio track synchronization

### Phase 3: Basic Editing
**Goal:** Core transcript editing functionality

- [ ] Design edit data model (edits as overlay on original)
- [ ] Implement SQLite storage for edit history
- [ ] Build word selection UI
- [ ] Implement click-to-edit word
- [ ] Implement insert word (before/after)
- [ ] Implement delete word
- [ ] Build undo/redo system
- [ ] Implement auto-save with debounce
- [ ] Add visual indicators for edited words
- [ ] Build find/replace functionality

### Phase 4: Advanced Editing
**Goal:** Full editing capabilities for production use

- [ ] Implement speaker reassignment
- [ ] Implement turn boundary adjustment
- [ ] Add annotation insertion ([laughter], [pause], etc.)
- [ ] Build merge/split word tools
- [ ] Implement bulk operations
- [ ] Add edit history viewer
- [ ] Build comparison view (original vs edited)
- [ ] Keyboard shortcut system

### Phase 5: De-identification Tools
**Goal:** Specialized tools for PII review and correction

- [ ] Build PII highlight overlay mode
- [ ] Implement manual redaction tool
- [ ] Add redaction category selector
- [ ] Build redaction override (unmark false positives)
- [ ] Implement placeholder text editing
- [ ] Add de-identification audit view
- [ ] Build second-pass review workflow
- [ ] Create de-identification report export

### Phase 6: Polish & Export
**Goal:** Production-ready with export capabilities. Note that we have already built these output writers

- [ ] Implement export to multiple formats (TXT, DOCX, JSON, SRT)
- [ ] Add export options (include timestamps, speaker labels, etc.)
